<title>UK: SOCCER-MERSON JOINS MIDDLESBROUGH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MERSON JOINS MIDDLESBROUGH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>England midfielder Paul Merson was reported to have signed for first division Middlesbrough on Monday.</p>
<p>Middlesbrough, relegated from the premier league last season, were said to have paid Arsenal five million pounds ($8.5 million) for the player.</p>
